2 CONT Osmund was baptized July 24 1828 in Stavanger Domkirke.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents listed are Aadne Osmundsen Storhoug and Severine Christine
2 CONT
2 CONT OSMOND STORHAUG AGED 92 PASSES AWAY
2 CONT
2 CONT Grandpa A Storhaug, Hudson's oldest inhabitant died at the home of his daughter, Mrs. Helmik Lode on Tuesday evening, aged 92 years , 2 months and 7 days.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in Stavanger, Norway, on July 20, 1828. He was married to Juliana Essekina Newman on March 15 , 1852, six children being born to this union. One son died in infancy , one son passed away in 1872 , the good wife and two
2 CONC  other sons dying in 1874, leaving two daughters , Mrs Lode and Mrs Christine Olson, who died three years ago, leaving but one daughter Mrs lode as the sole member of the immediate family. Nine grandchildren and eighteen grandchil
2 CONC dren also survive him.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a fine old gentleman, an honest, God fearing man, who was ever upright in all his dealings with his fellow man. Residing in this vicinity for 33 years , he was well known in this community, and all who knew him liked him. H
2 CONC e was robust and healthy until a few years ago , being remarkably well and strong for his years , and he was a familiar figure Honor streets up to a year or so ago , since which time his decline has been rapid.
2 CONT
2 CONT ** In 1884 he came to this country, settling in Edenburg, Washington, where he lived for 3 years, then Coming to Hudson and making his home with his daughter Mrs. Christine Olson , until her death 3 years ago , since which he has 
2 CONC been living with his remaining daughter Mrs. Lode ,receiving the loving care of the family during his declining years , for he has been feeble and bedfast most of the time during the last two or three years , but every tender care
2 CONC  was his , and no daughter ever better , or more tender , of her fathers care , comfort and wishes than she. 
2 CONT
2 CONT **
