1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Ingeborg ChristinaTollaksdaughter went to Minnesota with 6 children after her husband Christopher and son Jonas froze to death in the boat on their way to Lyse from Haaheller. Christina's brother Halvor Tollakson 
2 CONC had already gone to Minnesota, and worked in the Gold Mines. He sent Christina money for the tickets.
